			],
			"Message": "fix(Element): Advance submodule — hierarchy prepare routing fix and config notification forwarding\n\nAdvance the Element container submodule to fix silent call/type hierarchy failures in Cocoon and add configuration change event forwarding from Mountain.\n\n**Cocoon (GRPCServerService routing):** The method router regex gate only matched $provide* and $resolve* language feature patterns, dropping $prepareCallHierarchyItems and $prepareTypeHierarchyItems requests before they reached InvokeLanguageProvider. Extend the router to also accept $prepare* patterns, restoring call and type hierarchy intelligence in the extension host.\n\n**Mountain (Vine config notifications):** Forward workspace configuration update events to Cocoon via a fire-and-forget Vine notification, carrying the changed key in the payload. This enables vscode.workspace.onDidChangeConfiguration to fire for extensions like rust-analyzer, ESLint, and Prettier. A Vine send failure must not propagate and fail the caller's awaiting IPC response.\n\nBoth hierarchy language features and config-change reactivity now function correctly across the Mountain ↔ Cocoon gRPC boundary.",
			"SHA": "74cae26ac59233f3e5a7b49e471eac459bde1a1b"
		}
